# Candor — optional environment configuration.
#
# Copy to `.env` (development: next to package.json) or to `%APPDATA%\Candor\.env` (installed app).
# Variables that are already set in the real environment win over this file.
#
# Keys set here are read by the main process only. They are never sent to the UI, never written to the
# database, and never logged. Keys you paste into Settings are stored encrypted with Windows DPAPI instead,
# and a key stored in Settings takes priority over one from the environment.
# Never commit a real `.env`.

# --- LLM providers ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# You still create the provider entry in Settings → AI Providers (name + base URL); leave its key field
# empty and Candor picks the key up from here.
# Used for a provider whose base URL is https://api.openai.com/v1 (other OpenAI-compatible services such
# as Groq or OpenRouter need their own key entered in Settings).
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# Used for Anthropic providers.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Used for Google Gemini providers (GEMINI_API_KEY is accepted as an alias).
GOOGLE_API_KEY=

# --- Google sign-in instead of an API key (Application Default Credentials) -------------------------
# Normally you just run `gcloud auth application-default login` (see docs/GOOGLE-ADC.md). These are the standard
# Google variables, read by Google's own auth library; Candor never reads the credential file itself.
# Path to a service-account key or workload-identity-federation config (many organisations forbid key files).
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=C:\path\to\credentials.json
# The Google Cloud project to bill, when it is not set in Settings.
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=my-project-123

# --- Streaming speech-to-text -------------------------------------------------------------------
DEEPGRAM_API_KEY=
ASSEMBLYAI_API_KEY=
# Generic fallback used for whichever STT provider is selected and has no key of its own.
STT_API_KEY=

# --- App behaviour (all optional) ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Override where the database, encrypted secrets and logs live (default: %APPDATA%\Candor).
# CANDOR_USER_DATA=D:\CandorData
# error | warn | info | debug   (no level ever logs keys, prompts, transcripts or audio)
# CANDOR_LOG_LEVEL=info
# Diagnosing a model that answers in the wrong format: 1 = also save raw model replies to logs\ai-debug.jsonl on this PC
# (credentials masked, never sent anywhere); full = replies AND prompts (prompts contain your résumé and job text). Off by default.
# CANDOR_DEBUG_AI=1

# Optional: a folder that holds <model id>/ folders for the on-device speech engine (defaults to the bundled models).
# CANDOR_STT_MODELS_DIR=
